  {
   "text": "LORD, our Lord, how majestic is your name in all the earth",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the mouths of children and infants",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have established strength because of your foes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To silence the enemy and the avenger",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When I look at your heavens, the work of your fingers",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The moon and the stars that you set in place",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What is a human being that you remember him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A son of man that you care for him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "LORD, our Lord, how majestic is your name in all the earth",
