   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And crowned him with glory and honor",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You gave him dominion over the works of your hands",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You put everything under his feet",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All the flocks and herds, and the beasts of the field as well",
